msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>"
"<p>URL to clone the protocol from, like:<br/>"
"git clone git://anongit.kde.org/kdevelop<br/>"
"git clone kde:kdevelop</p>"
"<p>For more information go <a href=\"https://community.kde.org/Sysadmin/GitKdeOrgManual#Overview_of_repository_URL_schemes\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#0057ae;\">here</span></a>.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body> "
"<p>URL a partir da que clonar o protocolo, como por exemplo:<br/>"
" git clone git://anongit.kde.org/kdevelop<br/>"
" git clone kde:kdevelop</p>"
" "
"<p>Para máis información léase a <a href=\"https://community.kde.org/Sysadmin/GitKdeOrgManual#Overview_of_repository_URL_schemes\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#0057ae;\">documentación</span></a>.</p>"
"</body></html>"

